Para ahli domain bakal bisa menehi informasi sing luwih sistematis.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.000
Mesthi wae, iki mung salah sawijining conto nganalisa domain sing kompleks.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.320
Bisa uga ana cara liya sing apik

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.740
Penting kanggo nanggapi kanthi fleksibel gumantung saka kahanane.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.060
Iki kesimpulane

