00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.250
Amarga kita kudu ngatur konsep-konsep sing paling abstrak lan samar.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.650
Sabanjure kita bakal ngrembug babagan kasus panggunaan utama

